  /* Keep one continuous transport clock between YouTube samples. getCurrentTime()
     can arrive in coarse/jittery steps on iOS; snapping every sample made the
     divider appear to replay at musical boundaries. Normal drift is corrected
     by a tiny rate slew, never by a position jump. Only a real seek/loop (>1.25s)
     is allowed to re-anchor position. */
