function finish(options){if(!S.session||finish._busy)return;options=options&&typeof options==='object'?options:{};var afterRoute=String(options.afterRoute||'calendar'),failureRoute=afterRoute==='workout'?'workout':afterRoute;finish._busy=true;S.elapsed=elapsed();S.running=false;loading('SAVING WORKOUT','Updating your training history…');post({action:'finish',id:S.session.id,body:S.items,name:S.name,duration:Math.round(S.elapsed),programId:S.activeProgramId,dayIndex:S.activeDayIndex}).then(function(r){if(!r.data.ok)throw new Error(r.data.error||'Workout could not be saved.');/* The persisted finish is newer than every client-side history projection. Invalidate both caches so the next Progress/history read requests the canonical completed session. */EX_HISTORY_CACHE=Object.create(null);S.progress=null;TRAINING_FOUNDATION.loaded=false;clearLocal();S.session=null;S.items=[];S.elapsed=0;S.started=0;S.running=false;S.activeProgramId=null;S.activeDayIndex=null;S._afterFinishRoute=afterRoute;if(typeof paintActiveWorkoutPersistent==='function')paintActiveWorkoutPersistent();boot()}).catch(function(error){finish._busy=false;S.started=Date.now();S.running=true;saveLocal();myToast(error&&error.message||'Workout could not be saved.');if(failureRoute==='workout')workout();else{var route=typeof mahfittCurrentRoute==='function'?mahfittCurrentRoute():null;if(route&&route.view===failureRoute)mahfittRenderRoute(route);else mahfittNavigate(failureRoute)}startTick()})}
